#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.window.rolling.LiteFrameRolling.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.window.rolling.LiteFrameRolling"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.rolling.LiteFrameRolling:1 of
msgid "Intermediate object returned by ``LiteFrame.rolling()``."
msgstr "由 ``LiteFrame.rolling()`` 返回的中间对象。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.rolling.LiteFrameRolling:3 of
msgid ""
"Provides rolling-window aggregations over a fixed-size integer window. "
"Execution uses the **sliced-data (concatenate-compute-slice)** cross-"
"chunk strategy: for multi-chunk inputs, up to ``window - 1`` boundary "
"rows are fetched from neighbor chunks, concatenated, the aggregation is "
"computed over the concatenation, and the result is sliced back to the "
"chunk's range."
msgstr ""
"在固定大小的整数窗口上提供滚动窗口聚合。执行使用 **切片数据（连接-计算-"
"切片）** 跨块策略：对于多块输入，从相邻块获取最多 ``window - 1`` 个边界行"
"，进行连接，在连接结果上计算聚合，然后将结果切片回该块的范围。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.window.rolling.LiteFrameRolling.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.rolling.LiteFrameRolling:9 of
msgid "The frame to compute over."
msgstr "要计算的框架。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.rolling.LiteFrameRolling:11 of
msgid ""
"Size of the moving window (number of rows). Must be a positive integer. "
"Offset/time-based windows are not yet supported."
msgstr "移动窗口的大小（行数）。必须是正整数。尚未支持基于偏移量/时间的窗口。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.rolling.LiteFrameRolling:14 of
msgid ""
"Minimum number of observations in a window required to produce a value "
"(otherwise null). Defaults to ``window`` (matching pandas)."
msgstr ""
"窗口中产生值所需的最小观测数（否则为null）。默认为 ``window`` （与pandas"
"匹配）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.rolling.LiteFrameRolling:17 of
msgid "If True, the window is centered on the current row."
msgstr "如果为True，则窗口以当前行为中心。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.rolling.LiteFrameRolling:19 of
msgid ""
"Column(s) to aggregate. If None, all (non-hidden, non-group-key) columns "
"are aggregated. Non-selected columns are passed through."
msgstr ""
"要聚合的列。如果为None，则聚合所有（非隐藏、非分组键）列。未选择的列会被"
"传递通过。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.rolling.LiteFrameRolling:22 of
msgid ""
"Set when created from a ``groupby.rolling()`` call so the tiler "
"partitions data by group key before computing per-group windows."
msgstr ""
"从 ``groupby.rolling()`` 调用创建时设置，以便tiler在计算每组窗口之前按"
"分组键对数据进行分区。"

